式未老之时，猱身上前，以枪为棍，向$n腰部横挥而出。]],["atkList"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang4P1]],["attack"]=15.49,["attackAverage"]=12.57,["damageType"]=[[刺伤#2]],["hit"]=0,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang4]],["lv"]=80,["skillId"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang]],["tiliCost"]=52,["topLimit"]=20,["zhaoId"]=4,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第四招]],["zhaoName"]=[[比翼连枝]]},["baniaochaofengqiang5"]={["actionText"]=[[$N一按枪把，啪！地一声抖出五朵枪花，一招「孔雀开屏」，上下左右，虚虚实实刺向$n全身要害。]],["atkList"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang5P1]],["attack"]=19.98,["attackAverage"]=14.85,["damageType"]=[[刺伤#2]],["hit"]=0,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang5]],["lv"]=120,["skillId"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang]],["tiliCost"]=52,["topLimit"]=30,["zhaoId"]=5,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第五招]],["zhaoName"]=[[孔雀开屏]]},["baniaochaofengqiang6"]={["actionText"]=[[$N双手握$Nw正中，以$Nw两端向$n连续击打。]],["atkList"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang6P1]],["attack"]=24.64,["attackAverage"]=17.3,["damageType"]=[[刺伤#3]],["hit"]=0,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang6]],["lv"]=150,["skillId"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang]],["tiliCost"]=52,["topLimit"]=60,["zhaoId"]=6,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第六招]],["zhaoName"]=[[黄鹂翠柳]]},["baniaochaofengqiang7"]={["actionText"]=[[只见$N一个斜跨，使个「平沙落雁」，手中$Nw带出一道寒气，由上而下疾刺$n$l。]],["atkList"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang7P1]],["attack"]=29.37,["attackAverage"]=19.87,["damageType"]=[[刺伤#3]],["hit"]=0,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang7]],["lv"]=180,["skillId"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang]],["tiliCost"]=52,["topLimit"]=90,["zhaoId"]=7,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第七招]],["zhaoName"]=[[平沙落雁]]},["baniaochaofengqiang8"]={["actionText"]=[[$N跃至半空，手握枪尾，凌空扫向$n$l。]],["atkList"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang8P1]],["attack"]=34.19,["attackAverage"]=22.51,["damageType"]=[[刺伤#4]],["hit"]=0,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang8]],["lv"]=220,["skillId"]=[[baniaochaofengqiang]],["tiliCost"]=52,["topLimit"]=120,["zhaoId"]=8,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第八招]],["zhaoName"]=[[白云黄鹤]]},["baniaochaofengqiang9"]={["actionText"]=[[只见$N手腕一翻，手中$Nw从意想不到的角度刺向$n的$l。这一招「玄鸟划沙」快若闪电，毒辣无