让$n难以躲闪。]],["atkList"]=[[bigDipperZenStick9P1]],["attack"]=61.75,["attackAverage"]=31.49,["damageType"]=[[砸伤#1]],["hit"]=0.8,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[bigDipperZenStick9]],["lv"]=400,["skillId"]=[[bigDipperZenStick]],["tiliCost"]=50,["topLimit"]=324,["zhaoId"]=9,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第九招]],["zhaoName"]=[[横扫六合]]},["bingpohandao1"]={["actionText"]=[[$N轻抚手中的$Nw，突然间只见刀光一闪，RAN「再闪，又一闪」NOR！三道刺骨的寒气已然袭上了$n的$l。]],["atkList"]=[[bingpohandao1P1#bingpohandao1P2]],["attack"]=6.65,["attackAverage"]=6.65,["damageType"]=[[砍伤#1]],["hit"]=0.3,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[bingpohandao1]],["lv"]=0,["skillId"]=[[bingpohandao]],["tiliCost"]=53,["topLimit"]=0,["zhaoId"]=1,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第一招]],["zhaoName"]=[[冰刃凝魄]]},["bingpohandao2"]={["actionText"]=[[只见$N倒提$Nw，RAN「身形急冲」NOR，就在与$n错身之际，突然反手一刀从$n后脑斜劈而下。]],["atkList"]=[[bingpohandao2P1#bingpohandao2P2]],["attack"]=7.6,["attackAverage"]=7.13,["damageType"]=[[砍伤#2]],["hit"]=0.3,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[bingpohandao2]],["lv"]=30,["skillId"]=[[bingpohandao]],["tiliCost"]=53,["topLimit"]=0,["zhaoId"]=2,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第二招]],["zhaoName"]=[[五月飞霜]]},["bingpohandao3"]={["actionText"]=[[$N斜身飞起，带出一片匹练也似的RAN「刀光」NOR卷向$n的$l。]],["atkList"]=[[bingpohandao3P1]],["attack"]=9.56,["attackAverage"]=7.94,["damageType"]=[[挫伤#3]],["hit"]=0.3,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[bingpohandao3]],["lv"]=50,["skillId"]=[[bingpohandao]],["tiliCost"]=53,["topLimit"]=20,["zhaoId"]=3,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第三招]],["zhaoName"]=[[寒风三卷]]},["bingpohandao4"]={["actionText"]=[[$N突然一脚踢出，手中的$Nw划出一道RAN「轻妙的圆弧」NOR，淡淡的刀光封住了$n的头脸，切断了$n的呼吸。]],["atkList"]=[[bingpohandao4P1#bingpohandao4P2]],["attack"]=13.46,["attackAverage"]=9.32,["damageType"]=[[挫伤#4]],["hit"]=0.3,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[bingpohandao4]],["lv"]=60,["skillId"]=[[bingpohandao]],["tiliCost"]=53,["topLimit"]=40,["zhaoId"]=4,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第四招]],["zhaoName"]=[[冷凝滞物]]},["bingpohandao5"]={["actionText"]=[[只见$N脸色一寒，一招RAN「千里冰封」NOR使出，从眉捷到脚跟，$n周身的血液都似被这无尽的刀势冻住，而生命也仿佛要离体而去。]],["atkList"]=[[bing