翻，格开$n手臂，接着砰的一拳，已结结实实打在$n$l。]],["atkList"]=[[qishangquan10P1]],["attack"]=7.78,["attackAverage"]=4.93,["damageType"]=[[瘀伤#7]],["hit"]=0.35,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[qishangquan10]],["lv"]=140,["skillId"]=[[qishangquan]],["tiliCost"]=50,["topLimit"]=48,["zhaoId"]=10,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第十招]],["zhaoName"]=[[失神诀]]},["qishangquan11"]={["actionText"]=[[$N乘$n开口说话，猛然出拳打去，只听砰的一声大响，这一次正巧是打在$n$l上。]],["atkList"]=[[qishangquan11P1]],["attack"]=8.71,["attackAverage"]=5.43,["damageType"]=[[瘀伤#7]],["hit"]=0.35,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[qishangquan11]],["lv"]=160,["skillId"]=[[qishangquan]],["tiliCost"]=50,["topLimit"]=50,["zhaoId"]=11,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第十一招]],["zhaoName"]=[[三焦逆诀]]},["qishangquan12"]={["actionText"]=[[$N拳出如风，砰砰接连四拳，都打在$n身上，但却似不关痛痒，便如清风拂体，柔丝抚身。]],["atkList"]=[[qishangquan12P1]],["attack"]=9.66,["attackAverage"]=5.95,["damageType"]=[[瘀伤#8]],["hit"]=0.35,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[qishangquan12]],["lv"]=180,["skillId"]=[[qishangquan]],["tiliCost"]=50,["topLimit"]=60,["zhaoId"]=12,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第十二招]],["zhaoName"]=[[衰魂决]]},["qishangquan13"]={["actionText"]=[[$N双目尽赤，一声吆喝，宛似凭空打了个霹雳，猛响声中，一拳直出打在$n的$l之上。]],["atkList"]=[[qishangquan13P1]],["attack"]=10.65,["attackAverage"]=6.47,["damageType"]=[[瘀伤#8]],["hit"]=0.35,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[qishangquan13]],["lv"]=200,["skillId"]=[[qishangquan]],["tiliCost"]=50,["topLimit"]=80,["zhaoId"]=13,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第十三招]],["zhaoName"]=[[损阳决]]},["qishangquan14"]={["actionText"]=[[$N暗运几口真气，跨上一步，手臂骨格格作响，接着劈的一声，一拳打向$n$l。]],["atkList"]=[[qishangquan14P1]],["attack"]=11.62,["attackAverage"]=7,["damageType"]=[[瘀伤#9]],["hit"]=0.35,["hurtPosClass"]=[[default]],["id"]=[[qishangquan14]],["lv"]=220,["skillId"]=[[qishangquan]],["tiliCost"]=50,["topLimit"]=90,["zhaoId"]=14,["zhaoIdText"]=[[第十四招]],["zhaoName"]=[[摧肝断肠决]]},["qishangquan15"]={["actionText"]=[[$N一拳击出，缩回手臂，又发拳打，退了一步，运气数转，重又上前，挺拳猛击。]],["atkList"]=[[qishangquan15P1]],["attack"]=12.59,["attackAverage"]=7.54,["damageType"]=[[瘀伤#9]],["hit"]=0.35,[